175 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 135 0 R
/T (Software applications have traditionally been built by writing thousands of lines of code using programming languages such as Java, Python, C#, and JavaScript. This process is called Traditional Coding, and it has been the foundation of enterprise and consumer software for decades.  Modern businesses, however, need applications much faster than traditional development can provide.  This need has driven the rise of Low-Code Development Platforms, such as Zoho Creator, Microsoft  Power Apps, Mendix, and OutSystems. Zoho Creator, in particular, is a low-code platform with AI- assisted capabilities that enables users to create fully functional business applications with minimal  coding effort. )
/E (Software applications have traditionally been built by writing thousands of lines of code using programming languages such as Java, Python, C#, and JavaScript. This process is called Traditional Coding, and it has been the foundation of enterprise and consumer software for decades.  Modern businesses, however, need applications much faster than traditional development can provide.  This need has driven the rise of Low-Code Development Platforms, such as Zoho Creator, Microsoft  Power Apps, Mendix, and OutSystems. Zoho Creator, in particular, is a low-code platform with AI- assisted capabilities that enables users to create fully functional business applications with minimal  coding effort. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
