545 0 obj
<<
/Title (Low-Code Development:  An approach that uses visual interfaces, drag-and-drop components, and minimal hand-written code to build applications quickly and efficiently. Traditional \(Custom\) Coding:  An approach in which professional developers manually design, write, test, and implement all aspects of an application's source code using programming languages. AI-Assisted Development:   The use of artificial intelligence within a development platform to automate and accelerate application creation by suggesting layouts, and recommending reports or dashboards. Drag-and-Drop Builder:  A visual development interface that enables users to construct application components by dragging and placing pre-built elements manually.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 351 0 R
/Prev 606 0 R
/First 607 0 R
/Last 607 0 R
/Count -1
>>
